<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian April wholesale prices up 0.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Austrian April wholesale prices up 0.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	    APRIL	MARCH    APRIL 1996</p>
<p> Monthly WPI index rise	 0.2	-0.2	     -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr index rise	    0.3	-0.1	     -0.5</p>
<p> Index			    100.5	100.3	   104.8</p>
<p>NOTES -- The April and March 1997 index figures are based on 1996 = 100, while the April 1996 figure is based on 1986 = 100.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
</text>
